MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Slopes at the daily means from the harmonic mean of neighbouring secants (Fritsch & Butland 1984); the Hermite
cubic passes through every daily mean and its time derivative is continuous. Run file
runs/glorys-sqrtH-tendency-4d.toml: tendency on, relaxation over 5 days.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
